# Option parsing is strict and resource replacement is transactional.
@phase 4.1
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< setoption name Hash value 128
! silence 50ms
< setoption name Threads value 4
! silence 50ms
< setoption name Threads value 0
> info string invalid setoption: Threads is outside 1..1024
! fail-next thread-allocation
< setoption name Threads value 2
> info string failed setoption: Threads resource allocation failed
< setoption name Threads value 1
! silence 50ms
< setoption name Hash value 0
> info string invalid setoption: Hash is outside 1..1048576
< setoption name Future Knob value 1
> info string unknown option "future knob" ignored
! fail-next hash-allocation
< setoption name Hash value 256
> info string failed setoption: Hash resource allocation failed
< isready
> readyok
< setoption name Clear Hash value now
> info string invalid setoption: Clear Hash does not take a value
< setoption name Clear Hash
! silence 50ms
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
